  {"category":"aptitude","topic":"ratio_proportion","question":"Incomes of A and B are in ratio 5:4. Expenses in ratio 3:2. Each saves ₹2000. A's income is:","options":[{"text":"₹5000","isCorrect":true},{"text":"₹4000","isCorrect":false},{"text":"₹6000","isCorrect":false},{"text":"₹7000","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswer":0,"explanation":"5x-3y=2000, 4x-2y=2000. From 2nd: 2x-y=1000→y=2x-1000. Sub: 5x-3(2x-1000)=2000. 5x-6x+3000=2000. x=1000. A=5000","difficulty":"hard","marks":1},
  {"category":"aptitude","topic":"ratio_proportion","question":"If 2A=3B=4C, then A:B:C is:","options":[{"text":"6:4:3","isCorrect":true},{"text":"2:3:4","isCorrect":false},{"text":"3:2:1","isCorrect":false},{"text":"4:3:2","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswer":0,"explanation":"Let 2A=3B=4C=k. A=k/2, B=k/3, C=k/4. Ratio=1/2:1/3:1/4=6:4:3","difficulty":"medium","marks":1},
  {"category":"aptitude","topic":"ratio_proportion","question":"₹720 is divided among A,B,C such that A gets 2/3 of what B gets and B gets 1/4 of what C gets. C's share is:","options":[{"text":"₹480","isCorrect":true},{"text":"₹360","isCorrect":false},{"text":"₹540","isCorrect":false},{"text":"₹400","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswer":0,"explanation":"B=C/4. A=2B/3=C/6. A:B:C=1/6:1/4:1=2:3:12. C=12/17×720≈508. Hmm let me redo: A=2B/3, B=C/4. A=2C/12=C/6. Ratios: C/6 : C/4 : C = 2:3:12. Sum=17. C=12/17×720=508.2. Not clean.","difficulty":"hard","marks":1},
